base Cleanup'=>'Datebank-Botzen','Date'=>'Datum','Date Format'=>'Datumsformat','Date Picker Format'=>'Format vum Datumsselekter','Date Preview Mode'=>'Modus fir d\'Datumsvirschau','Date Separator'=>'Datumstrennzeechen','Date and Time'=>'Datum an Zäit','Date and Time formats follow the <a href="%s">WordPress time formatting conventions</a>'=>'Datums- an Zäitformater follegen de <a href="%s">WordPress-Konventioune fir d\'Zäitformatéierung</a>','Date and time'=>'Datum an Zäit','Date/Time'=>'Datum/Zäit','Dates'=>'Datumen','Dates must have correct formatting. Please use the date picker provided.'=>'D\'Datume mussen dat richtegt Format hunn. Benotzt w.e.g. de Datumsauswieler.','Dates such as 2027-03-04 or March 4, 2027 are always read the same way.'=>'Datumen wéi 2027-03-04 oder March 4, 2027 ginn ëmmer op déiselwecht Manéier gelies.','Dates written as numbers'=>'Datumen als Zuelen geschriwwen','Day %d'=>'Dag %d','Day first: 03/04/2027 is April 3'=>'Dag fir d\'éischt: 03/04/2027 ass den 3. Abrëll','Days of week'=>'Wochendeeg','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>You have requested #_BOOKINGSPACES space/spaces for #_EVENTNAME.<br/>When : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Where : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Your booking is currently pending approval by our administrators. Once approved you will receive an automatic confirmation.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Gudde Moien #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Dir hutt #_BOOKINGSPACES Plaz/Plazen fir #_EVENTNAME ugefrot.<br/>Wéini : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Wou : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Är Reservatioun waart de Moment op d\'Zoustëmmung vun eisen Administrateuren. Soubal se ugeholl ass, kritt Dir automatesch eng Bestätegung.<br/>Mat fréndleche Gréiss,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>You have successfully reserved #_BOOKINGSPACES space/spaces for #_EVENTNAME.<br/>When : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Where : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Gudde Moien #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Dir hutt erfollegräich #_BOOKINGSPACES Plaz/Plazen fir #_EVENTNAME reservéiert.<br/>Wéini : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Wou : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Mat fréndleche Gréiss,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Your requested booking for #_BOOKINGSPACES spaces at #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been cancelled.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Gudde Moien #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Är ugefroten Reservatioun vun #_BOOKINGSPACES Plazen bei #_EVENTNAME den #_EVENTDATES gouf annuléiert.<br/>Mat fréndleche Gréiss,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Your requested booking for #_BOOKINGSPACES spaces at #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been rejected.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Gudde Moien #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Är ugefroten Reservatioun vun #_BOOKINGSPACES Plazen bei #_EVENTNAME den #_EVENTDATES gouf ofgeleent.<br/>Mat fréndleche Gréiss,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear %s'=>'Gudde Moien %s','Dear Guest, <br/>We regret to inform you that #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been cancelled.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Gudde Moien, <br/>Mir bedaueren Iech matzedeelen, dass #_EVENTNAME den #_EVENTDATES annuléiert gouf.<br/>Mat fréndleche Gréiss,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Decimal Point'=>'Dezimalzeechen','Decode shortcode content?'=>'Shortcode-Inhalt dekodéieren?','Decode shortcode format parameters?'=>'Format-Parameteren vum Shortcode decodéieren?','Default'=>'Standard','Default %s color'=>'Standardfaarf fir %s','Default %s list format'=>'Standard-Lëschteformat fir %s','Default %s list options'=>'Standard-Lëschteoptioune fir %s','Default (site setting)'=>'Standard (Site-Astellung)','Default Category'=>'Standardkategorie','Default Country'=>'Standardland','Default List Scope'=>'Standardbereich vun der Lëscht','Default Location'=>'Standardplaz','Default Location Country'=>'Standardland vun der Plaz','Default Timezone'=>'Standard-Zäitzon','Default View'=>'Standardusiicht','Default archive ordering'=>'Standardsorté